---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; const entries=await getCollection('methodologies',({data})=>!data.draft);
---
<BaseLayout title="Carbon Methodology Library" description="A structured, source-conscious library for studying carbon credit methodologies."><header class="page-intro container"><span class="eyebrow">Carbon methodology library</span><h1>Reading the rules behind carbon credits.</h1><p>This library is designed for structured comparison of published methodologies. It focuses on what a methodology asks projects to demonstrate—without replacing the official source or independent review.</p></header><section class="container notice"><strong>Source standard</strong><p>Only reviewed public information is published. Draft examples and unverified requirements remain private.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="container">{entries.length?<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Methodology</th><th>Registry</th><th>Sector</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{entries.map(({id,data})=><tr><td><a href={`/methodologies/${id}/`}>{data.title}</a><br/><small>{data.methodologyId}</small></td><td>{data.registry}</td><td>{data.sector}</td><td>{data.status}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>:<div class="empty"><span class="eyebrow">Library status</span><h2>Entries are under review.</h2><p>The content model is ready. Public records will appear here after their requirements have been checked against official sources.</p></div>}</div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.notice{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;gap:30px}.notice p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.empty{padding:70px 0;max-width:70ch}.empty h2{margin:16px 0}.empty p{color:var(--muted)}small{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:600px){.notice{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
